      "role": "user",
      "content": "the superhero thing makes sense i guess lol. but what about phosphorus? you mentioned it helps with roots, but i'm mostly seeing these weird purple-ish tints on some of the blades. is that a thing? how can i tell if that's actually a phosphorus issue or just something else?",
      "source": "evaluator"
